s not approve.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Cheers.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/779479340804444874/comments/default/2805363093855449977'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/779479340804444874/comments/default/2805363093855449977'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/07/first-they-came-for-bar-owners.html?showComment=1439682062705#c2805363093855449977' title=''/><author><name>ray</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11380746207592226835</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/07/first-they-came-for-bar-owners.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-779479340804444874' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/779479340804444874' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2087141373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 15, 2015 at 5:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2087460794613739316</id><published>2015-07-27T15:25:03.223-06:00</published><updated>2015-07-27T15:25:03.223-06:00</updated><title type='text'>50 years ago, if one wanted to see the freak show,...</title><content type='html'>50 years ago, if one wanted to see the freak show, you had to wait until the circus came to town to see the &amp;#39;half-man, half-woman&amp;#39; on display.&lt;br /&gt;But people knew it was a joke, designed to separate the rubes from their hard-earned money.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Now days, the freak show is on 24/7, in all forms of media, and people are &amp;#39;oooing and awing&amp;#39; over some guy dressed in a woman&amp;#39;s dress and panty hose.&lt;br /&gt;And his own TV show, giving new life to the term &amp;#39;Boob Tube.&amp;#39;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/779479340804444874/comments/default/2087460794613739316'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/779479340804444874/comments/default/2087460794613739316'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/07/first-they-came-for-bar-owners.html?showComment=1438032303223#c2087460794613739316' title=''/><author><name>Greg Bacon</name><uri>http://careandwashingofthebrain.blogspot.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/07/first-they-came-for-bar-owners.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-779479340804444874' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/779479340804444874' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1381717517"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 27, 2015 at 3:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1205133757549231851</id><published>2015-07-24T10:37:03.905-06:00</published><updated>2015-07-24T10:37:03.905-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Lesson Number One:  GTFOO Oregon if you love liber...</title><content type='html'>Lesson Number One:  GTFOO Oregon if you love liberty and respect private property.  Anyone who would own a small business there is a obviously a candidate for incarceration in a mental health facility.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/779479340804444874/comments/default/1205133757549231851'/><link rel='self'