leWrights</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02108700971976990644</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='21' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_MknTgiDcOKU/Sbq4HYqLYUI/AAAAAAAAEok/Gy3CCv4L1xI/S220/constitution.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/07/first-they-came-for-bar-owners.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-779479340804444874' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/779479340804444874' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1008395888"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 24, 2015 at 9:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1402925449195690624</id><published>2015-07-24T08:21:23.107-06:00</published><updated>2015-07-24T08:21:23.107-06:00</updated><title type='text'>My family lived in Oregon from 1968 to 1979, event...</title><content type='html'>My family lived in Oregon from 1968 to 1979, eventually fleeing to Idaho. On occasion my wife has suggested that we should move back; I&amp;#39;ve made it clear that I have no desire to live in a state ruled by people who won&amp;#39;t let me pump my own gas. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/779479340804444874/comments/default/1402925449195690624'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/779479340804444874/comments/default/1402925449195690624'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/07/first-they-came-for-bar-owners.html?showComment=1437747683107#c1402925449195690624' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail'